  "term": "autocorrelation",
  "definition": "Autocorrelation, in this packet’s spatial context, means the degree to which nearby locations show similar patterns rather than being randomly distributed. Positive spatial autocorrelation indicates clustering, with high or similar values tending to occur together across neighboring areas.",
